# What a CLI deploy must not carry.
#
# `vercel deploy` uploads the working directory; the build then happens on
# Vercel from source, so every local build directory here is dead weight. A
# preview deploy was uploading 1.1GB — almost a gigabyte of it stale build
# output from the eval and check runs — and never completed.
.next
.next-*
outputs
coverage

# Local state and secrets. .env* is already excluded by Vercel, but the lab
# hub and downloaded backups are board data and have no business leaving
# this machine.
*.local
lab-hub
sync.json
